# Terraform heredocs (the Helm values in langfuse.tf and clickhouse.tf) keep their line endings, so
# a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true renders "\r\n" into the Helm release values. A plan from
# Windows and a plan from Linux CI then disagree and keep redeploying the release. Force LF.
*.tf     text eol=lf
*.tftpl  text eol=lf
*.hcl    text eol=lf
